      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOUCH OF REALITY (6) was yet again about the mark last start when runner-up over 2190m at Maryborough, beaten only a nose. Tackles a similar assignment and she can go right on with the job. CORBIE LAIDIR (2) is stepping out for the first time. By Stay Hungry and hails from the Lisa Pitt stable. Has the benefit of a good draw. Showed some ability when a minor placegetter in a recent trial and is well-placed to score at his first appearance. MUDDY (5) is ready to run a big race first-up from a spell following four trials. A positive betting push will add to the confidence. ULTIMATE GRANGE (7) is a three-year-old gelding by Ultimate Sniper from Dance Of Fire on debut. Interesting to see what unfolds from this wide draw. Was not far away in a recent trial. Finds a nice race so anticipating a bright start to his career.",
